before/valid: first cancellation retained through three callbacks
before/valid-with-error: first cancellation retained through three callbacks
before/malformed: first cancellation retained through three callbacks
before/empty: first cancellation retained through three callbacks
before/absent-with-error: first cancellation retained through three callbacks
before/absent-both: first cancellation retained through three callbacks
after/valid: first retained after later dictionary and empty reply, success
after/valid-with-error: first retained after later dictionary and empty reply, success
after/malformed: first retained after later dictionary and empty reply, parse_failure
after/empty: first retained after later dictionary and empty reply, parse_failure
after/absent-with-error: first retained after later dictionary and empty reply, remote_failure
after/absent-both: first retained after later dictionary and empty reply, empty_reply
